            "review_title": "Review at Altitude Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Mrgomeo\n7 contributions\n0\nI am happy with everything at Altitude Restaurant\nFeb 2020 • Family\nGood view. Located on the 32nd floor of Altara Suite. Altitude Restaurant not only gives you a beautiful and wide open view of the city,and the beach also.\n\nDelicious food. Altitude Restaurant offers you various choices from Vietnamese cuisine, Western and Korean food, so you can easily choose the dish that suits your taste.\n\nFriendly and helpful staff. They always look after you, take care of you from the smallest things. Especially my waiter, a young man named Hoang.\n\nAcceptable price. With every great things above then 350.000 vnd per pax ( 15$) is fine.\nRead more\nWritten February 15, 2020",
